    {
      "id": "dasam_ang_0277_line_0001",
      "lineIndex": 1,
      "gurmukhi": "ਖਹੇ ਵੀਰ ਧੀਰੰ ਉਠੀ ਸਸਤ੍ਰ ਝਾਰੰ ॥",
      "transliteration": "khahe veer dheera(n) uThee sasatr jhaara(n) ||",
      "translation": "The trumpets resounded violently, the warriors began to fight and the blows of weapons were showered",
      "punjabiViakhya": "ਧੀਰਜ ਵਾਲੇ ਸੂਰਮੇਾਂ ਆਪੋ ਵਿੱਚ ਖਹਿੰਦੇ ਸਨ।",
      "source": "DASAM_GRANTH",
      "ang": 277,
      "hindi": "",
      "hindiTransliteration": "खहे वीर धीरं उठी ससत्र झारं ॥",
      "sourceLineId": "86795",
      "sourceShabadId": "8057",
      "sourceUpdated": "2022-12-24 02:22:37",
      "raag": ""
    },
    {
      "id": "dasam_ang_0277_line_0002",
      "lineIndex": 2,
      "gurmukhi": "ਛਲੇ ਚਾਰ ਚਿਤ੍ਰੰ ਬਚਿੱਤ੍ਰੰਤ ਬਾਣੰ ॥",
      "transliteration": "chhale chaar chitra(n) bachi'tra(n)t baana(n) ||",
      "translation": "",
      "punjabiViakhya": "(ਉਨ੍ਰਹਾ ਦੇ) ਸ਼ਸਤ੍ਰਾ ਵਿੱਚੋਂ ਅੱਗ ਨਿਕਲਦੀ ਸੀ ਅਤੇ ਅਲੌਕਿਕ ਚਿੱਤਰਕਾਰੀ ਵਾਲੇ ਬਾਣ ਚਲਦੇ ਸਨ।",
      "source": "DASAM_GRANTH",
      "ang": 277,
      "hindi": "",
      "hindiTransliteration": "छले चार चित्रं बचित्त्रंत बाणं ॥",
      "sourceLineId": "86796",
      "sourceShabadId": "8057",
      "sourceUpdated": "2022-12-24 02:22:37",
      "raag": ""
    },
    {
      "id": "dasam_ang_0277_line_0003",
      "lineIndex": 3,
      "gurmukhi": "ਰਣੰ ਰੋਸ ਰੱਜੇ ਮਹਾ ਤੇਜਵਾਣੰ ॥੭੩੬॥",
      "transliteration": "rana(n) ros ra'je mahaa tejavaana(n) ||736||",
      "translation": "The arrows were discharged creating wondrous type of paintings and the mighty warriors moved in the battlefield being highly infuriated.736.",
      "punjabiViakhya": "ਵੱਡੇ ਤੇਜ ਵਾਲੇ ਸੂਰਮੇਾਂ ਯੁੱਧ ਦੇ ਰੋਸ ਨਾਲ ਭਰੇ ਪੀਤੇ (ਫਿਰਦੇ ਸਨ) ॥੭੩੬॥",
      "source": "DASAM_GRANTH",
      "ang": 277,
      "hindi": "",
      "hindiTransliteration": "रणं रोस रज्जे महा तेजवाणं ॥७३६॥",
      "sourceLineId": "86797",
      "sourceShabadId": "8057",
      "sourceUpdated": "2022-12-24 02:22:37",
      "raag": ""
    },
    {
